This project includes modified code derived from:
WZCQ by FengQuanLi: https://github.com/FengQuanLi/WZCQ
Related upstream project: https://github.com/FengQuanLi/ResnetGPT
The local project adds Linux/Jetson capture and control, three-state visual
classification, HUD OCR, temporal reward inference, and review tools.
This distribution reorganizes the selected code, translates names and data
schemas to English, and separates datasets, model weights, and generated output.
